a time and world where women have virtually no rights and are essentially men\u2019s property, and becomes one of Europe\u2019s most celebrated and in-demand painters of her time. \n\nArtemisia painted herself into posterity, she was a feminist at her core and this story is about how Artemisia rose up against the odds and impressed the whole of Europe with her talent within her own lifetime, and continues to capture our imaginat", "short_description": "A journey into the art that changed the world"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.historyofapainting.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HOAP", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.historyofapainting.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY", "NARRATIVE", "ART_CREATIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1575755259462627"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1668438460326730"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "868156001395060"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "372758421519191"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1668438460326730"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1694549993, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1668438460326730"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6630703373664401", "version": "2.1"}, 